    ],
    "text": "Establishment of National Hospital, Galle",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      424.98,
      542.5,
      462.45
    ],
    "text": "CONSIDERING the socio-economic benefits gained by the catchment population of the Southern Part of the country and the Teaching Hospital - Karapitiya has already fulfilled required service criteria for categorizing as a National Hospital, it was proposed to establish National Hospital, Galle replacing the Teaching Hospital - Karapitiya.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      472.98,
      542.51,
      498.45
    ],
    "text": "As per the decision of the Cabinet of Ministers made at the Cabinet meeting held on 13.05.2024, the Teaching Hospital - Karapitiya was upgraded and re-categorized as the National Hospital, Galle.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.99,
      508.82,
      513.46,
      546.45
    ],
